| lg | 24px | `p-6`, `gap-6` | Section padding, card padding |
| xl | 32px | `p-8`, `gap-8` | Large gaps |
| 2xl | 48px | `p-12` | Section margins |
| 3xl | 64px | `p-16` | Page-level padding |

